  THE SCHEDULE (the prediction under test)
    A Python loop over DDA steps unrolls at trace time. The question is
    whether tinygrad fuses across the unrolled body or emits one kernel per
    step. These are the counts, per max_steps, on this card:
     max_steps  launches  distinct  launches-8
             1         8         6           0
             4        12         9           4
            16        24        21          16
            32        40        37          32
  
  PERFORMANCE, both sides, same card, same run, same world, max_steps=32
    ref render / ref step are cudaEvent medians in MICROSECONDS. tg is the
    sum of per-kernel device times for the whole generated graph.
